                                                "sense_id": "84d08f99-487c-3e13-b772-7162d45e56d4",
                                                "text": "Women represent up to 90 percent of patients who seek treatment, Dr. Leonard B. Kaban, chief of oral and maxillofacial surgery at the Massachusetts General Hospital in Boston, said in an interview."
